OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786726080
OL,3,CTwo inmates charged with attempted
OL,4,Cmurder after Sara Sharif's father
OL,5,Cattacked
OL,7,FTwo men have been charged with
OL,8,Fattempted murder after the father of
OL,9,Fmurdered schoolgirl Sara Sharif was
OL,10,Fattacked in prison.
OL,12,FSteven Sansom, 47, and Adam Watson,
OL,13,F39, are accused of trying to kill
OL,14,FUrfan Sharif at HMP Belmarsh on New
OL,15,FYear's Day last year.
OL,17,FThe Crown Prosecution Service said the
OL,18,Fpair are due to appear at Westminster
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court on August 26.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/4
