PN,37202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786726080
OL,3,CTwo inmates charged with attempted
OL,4,Cmurder after Sara Sharif's father
OL,5,Cattacked
OL,7,FIt is understood the charges relate to
OL,8,Fan incident in which Sharif was
OL,9,Fallegedly ambushed in a cell at the
OL,10,Fcategory A prison by two inmates armed
OL,11,Fwith the jagged lid of a tuna tin.
OL,13,FDaren Streeter, deputy chief crown
OL,14,Fprosecutor at CPS London, said: "Our
OL,15,Fprosecutors have worked closely with
OL,16,Fthe Metropolitan Police to establish
OL,17,Fthat there is sufficient evidence to
OL,18,Fbring the case to court and pursue
OL,19,Fcriminal proceedings."
OL,26,@vD@aOU{D@VO]
