OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786726080
OL,3,CTwo inmates charged with attempted
OL,4,Cmurder after Sara Sharif's father
OL,5,Cattacked
OL,7,FThe Metropolitan Police previously
OL,8,Fsaid officers were probing "an
OL,9,Fallegation that a prisoner was
OL,10,Fassaulted at Belmarsh", adding that
OL,11,F"the 43-year-old suffered non life-
OL,12,Fthreatening injuries".
OL,14,FThe Sun reported that Sharif suffered
OL,15,Fcuts to his neck and face and received
OL,16,Fmedical treatment inside the prison.
OL,26,@pD@\OUrD@VO]sD@AOUtD@UO]
