PN,37204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786726080
OL,3,CTwo inmates charged with attempted
OL,4,Cmurder after Sara Sharif's father
OL,5,Cattacked
OL,7,FSharif and Sara's stepmother, Beinash
OL,8,FBatool, were jailed for life in
OL,9,FDecember for years of horrific
OL,10,F"torture" and "despicable" abuse that
OL,11,Fculminated in the 10-year-old's murder.
OL,13,FThe court heard that she suffered
OL,14,F"unimaginable pain, misery and
OL,15,Fanxiety" as she was repeatedly beaten,
OL,16,Fburned, bitten and restrained at the
OL,17,Ffamily home in Woking, Surrey.
OL,19,FSharif was handed a minimum term of 40
OL,20,Fyears and Batool was given 33 years.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@IO]rD@OOUrD@ZO]vD@AOUwD@HO]
